reak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しづつだけど\n演技よかったよ！と評価をもらえるようになったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その期待に応えられるように、評価を裏切らないように\n明日からも突っ走っていく！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファイティングウーマン！\n最近の口癖！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/08/3881025/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の私服っ！\nこれやっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね意識してみた♡\nちょっとかっこいい女風d=(^o^)=b"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はパンツスタイルにハマってるんだよね～\\( ^ω^ )/\nあとは白Tシャツもよく着る！！\nさりげなくハマってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/08/3881025/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/08/3881025/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/05/08/3881025/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして設楽さん、今日はありがとうございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふう\n明日からも学校だけど\n公演も続くし頑張ろう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここが頑張り時さd=(^o^)=b！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph"